</section>

<section class="about">
<h2>About the Mint</h2>
<p>WastedToken Mint crafts premium collectible challenge coins for the digital age. Each piece is struck with precision, finished with a proprietary metallic process, and sealed with a unique token identifier. From the first strike to the final flip, every coin tells a story of scarcity, craft, and community.</p>
